    <string name="challenge_guide_pushups">Start with your arms straight. Lower until your elbows bend about 90°, then push back up. Keep your shoulders, hips, and ankles in a straight line.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_wave">Show your palm and wrist to the camera. Move your hand sideways and back. One wave out and back counts as one.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_neck">Face the camera. Turn left and return to center, then turn right and return to center. Both sides count as one.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_jacks">Start with feet together and arms down. Jump your feet apart as you raise both arms, then return to the starting position. That counts as one.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_reach">Raise both elbows to about shoulder height and hold briefly. Lower both arms before the next rep.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_seated">Sit facing the camera. Start with your wrists below your shoulders, lift both above shoulder height, then lower them. That counts as one.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_standing">Stand sideways to the camera. Bend your knees, then stand upright again. That counts as one.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_words">The app compares the words it hears with the English passage on screen. You pass at 80/100. The score measures word match only.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_answer">Pick the correct answer to finish. You can try again if you get it wrong.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_camera">On-device AI recognizes the movement and counts each valid rep.</string>
    <string name="challenge_guide_scoring_title">How it’s checked</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_pushups">Keep your body straight. Lower until your elbows bend about 90°, then push back up.</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_wave">Open your palm and wave to one side, then back.</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_neck">Turn left and back to center, then right and back to center.</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_jacks">Jump your feet apart as you raise your arms, then jump back with your arms down.</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_reach">Lift both elbows to shoulder height, hold briefly, then lower your arms.</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_seated">Stay seated. Raise both hands above your shoulders, then lower them.</string>
    <string name="challenge_info_standing">Bend your knees slightly, then stand up straight.</string>
